Package: Canton
Title: Helpers for Data Analysis and Graphics Workflows
Version: 0.0.7
Authors@R: 
    person("Vik", "Wang", , "yehior@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2254-1871"))
Description: Small, focused helpers for routine data analysis workflows.
    Provides consistent saving of base, 'ggplot2', grid, 'pheatmap', and
    'ComplexHeatmap' plots to multiple formats, cross-platform plotting font
    configuration, publication presets and themes, colour palettes, font
    diagnostics, quiet package loading, and directory utilities.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/ScienceAdvances/Canton
BugReports: https://github.com/ScienceAdvances/Canton/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    systemfonts
Suggests: 
    ComplexHeatmap,
    pheatmap,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Additional_repositories: https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc
